WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.423 --> 00:00:07.857
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> So, we need to plan a special day for Alex.

2
00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:09.246
What do you think?

3
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.613
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> How about going to the cinema?

4
00:00:12.891 --> 00:00:17.969
Alex loves the cinema, and we can choose a film he likes.

5
00:00:18.069 --> 00:00:20.369
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> I’m not sure about that.

6
00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:23.370
We want to talk and laugh with Alex.

7
00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.781
We can’t do that in the cinema.

8
00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:27.148
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> That’s true.

9
00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:30.582
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> We need to think of a special activity –

10
00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:33.327
something we don’t do every day.

11
00:00:33.482 --> 00:00:36.260
What about going to an escape room?

12
00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:40.428
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> I don’t think that’s a very good idea.

13
00:00:40.572 --> 00:00:41.694
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> Why’s that?

14
00:00:41.794 --> 00:00:45.306
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Escape rooms are very expensive.

15
00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:50.307
Also, they’re only for one or two hours.

16
00:00:50.573 --> 00:00:53.940
We want to spend all day with Alex.

17
00:00:54.018 --> 00:00:55.174
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> You’re right.

18
00:00:55.307 --> 00:00:56.319
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> I know!

19
00:00:56.685 --> 00:01:01.108
How about having a picnic in the country.

20
00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:06.698
It isn’t expensive and we can stay all day.

21
00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.976
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> That’s a great idea!

22
00:01:09.109 --> 00:01:11.754
We can take our own lunch, too –

23
00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:15.265
for example, sandwiches and salads.

24
00:01:15.343 --> 00:01:24.078
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Yes, and we can do a lot of things like go for a walk or play games.

25
00:01:24.289 --> 00:01:27.300
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> We can have the picnic next weekend.

26
00:01:27.512 --> 00:01:32.901
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Great! Let’s make a list of Alex’s friends.

27
00:01:33.112 --> 00:01:36.002
We can send them a group invitation.